<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="light" lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="flex min-h-screen flex-col bg-surface text-on-surface hf-public-page">
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl flex-grow px-margin-mobile py-8 md:px-margin-desktop md:py-12">
      <nav class="hf-auth-stepper mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl md:mb-10" aria-label="Landlord onboarding progress">
        <ol class="hf-auth-stepper-list" role="list">
          <li class="hf-auth-stepper-step is-complete">
            <span class="hf-auth-stepper-marker"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">check</span></span>
            <span class="hf-auth-stepper-label">Profile</span>
          </li>
          <li class="hf-auth-stepper-step is-current" aria-current="step">
            <span class="hf-auth-stepper-marker">2</span>
            <span class="hf-auth-stepper-label">Verification</span>
          </li>
          <li class="hf-auth-stepper-step">
            <span class="hf-auth-stepper-marker">3</span>
            <span class="hf-auth-stepper-label">Finish</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">
        <div class="lg:col-span-8">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <p class="mb-2 text-label-md font-bold text-secondary">Step 2 of 3</p>
            <h1 class="mb-3 text-headline-lg font-bold text-primary">Review landlord verification requirements</h1>
            <p class="max-w-2xl text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
              Prepare the documents that may be needed to confirm identity, address,
              and authority to manage a property. No documents are submitted on this screen.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-8 rounded-lg border border-warning bg-warning-container px-4 py-4 text-on-warning-container" role="note">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">lock</span>
              <div>
                <p class="font-bold">Secure document upload is not configured</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm">Do not send identity, banking, or ownership documents through the contact form. This page is a preparation checklist only.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-5">
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5 sm:p-6" aria-labelledby="landlord-identity-title">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
                <div class="flex gap-3">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined mt-1 text-primary" aria-hidden="true">badge</span>
                  <div>
                    <h2 id="landlord-identity-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Identity</h2>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">One current government-issued document may be requested.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="hf-status-pill inline-flex min-h-8 items-center self-start rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-3 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">Not submitted</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3" role="list">
                <li class="rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-3 text-body-sm">Passport</li>
                <li class="rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-3 text-body-sm">Driving licence</li>
                <li class="rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-3 text-body-sm">National identity card</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5 sm:p-6" aria-labelledby="landlord-address-title">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
                <div class="flex gap-3">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined mt-1 text-primary" aria-hidden="true">home_pin</span>
                  <div>
                    <h2 id="landlord-address-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Address</h2>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">A recent document showing the account holder name and current address may be requested.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="hf-status-pill inline-flex min-h-8 items-center self-start rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-3 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">Not submitted</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3" role="list">
                <li class="rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-3 text-body-sm">Utility bill</li>
                <li class="rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-3 text-body-sm">Bank statement</li>
                <li class="rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-3 text-body-sm">Council tax statement</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5 sm:p-6" aria-labelledby="landlord-authority-title">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
                <div class="flex gap-3">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined mt-1 text-primary" aria-hidden="true">apartment</span>
                  <div>
                    <h2 id="landlord-authority-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Property authority</h2>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Evidence should show ownership or permission to manage the relevant property.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="hf-status-pill inline-flex min-h-8 items-center self-start rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-3 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">Not submitted</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2" role="list">
                <li class="rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-3 text-body-sm">Land Registry title or mortgage statement</li>
                <li class="rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-3 text-body-sm">Management agreement or lease document</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5 sm:p-6" aria-labelledby="landlord-business-title">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
                <div class="flex gap-3">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined mt-1 text-primary" aria-hidden="true">business</span>
                  <div>
                    <h2 id="landlord-business-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Business details</h2>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Company or partnership accounts may be asked for registration and authorized-representative details.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="hf-status-pill inline-flex min-h-8 items-center self-start rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-3 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">If applicable</span>
              </div>
            </section>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-outline-variant pt-6 sm:flex-row">
            <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant px-6 font-bold text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/onboarding-landlord">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">arrow_back</span>
              Edit profile
            </a>
            <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-6 font-bold text-on-primary hover:bg-primary-container" href="/onboarding-complete">
              Continue to setup summary
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:col-span-4" aria-labelledby="landlord-checklist-title">
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 shadow-sm">
            <p class="mb-2 text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Preparation checklist</p>
            <h2 id="landlord-checklist-title" class="mb-4 text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Before uploading later</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-4" role="list">
              <li class="flex gap-3 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span><span>Use clear, complete documents with readable names, dates, and addresses.</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span><span>Check that documents are current and relate to the account or property being reviewed.</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span><span>Review the final request before sharing any personal or financial information.</span></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="mt-6 border-t border-outline-variant pt-5">
              <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-primary hover:underline" href="/contact#contact-form">Ask about verification</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
